{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/1170311-what-do-you-want-necromancy-to-do","id":1170311,"title":"What do you want Necromancy to do?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Abyssal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-12-24T16:15:36-08:00","id":1170311,"title":"What do you want Necromancy to do?","content":"Besides animating corpses, creating various monsters from corpses, summoning and binding ghosts, traveling to and from the Underworld, manipulating the Underworld, and ripping out the souls of the living so as to enslave their corpses, hungry ghosts, AND higher-soul ghosts all at the same time...<br /> <br /> Is there anything else you want it to be able to do?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T16:17:13-08:00","id":1170312,"title":"","content":"Sending ghosts into Lethe and protecting higher souls from being raised as ghosts.<br /> <br /> There should be &quot;nice&quot; reasons to become a necromancer. After all, once you've already made the commitment, picking up just one naughty spell becomes so much easier...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Solar Kitten","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3907-aretii","name":"Aretii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3907_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T19:12:16-08:00","id":1170338,"title":"","content":"I'd like to see an interaction that's beneficial to have both Sorcery and Necromancy. Maybe extending the Terminus on workings, or allowing extra chances to countermagic or to distort Sorcery. <br /> <br /> There's plenty of room for &quot;nice&quot; necromancy, in funerary workings. <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T20:50:07-08:00","id":1170357,"title":"","content":"A horde of zombies. And a lot of options for creating different types of undeads.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T02:56:42-08:00","id":1170397,"title":"","content":"'''Imortality''' for those of the desperate mortal persausion. So many Liminals........ so so many...........","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11701-fiikragg","name":"Fiikragg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11701_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T06:14:03-08:00","id":1170414,"title":"","content":"This depends on wether necromancy is meant to be the magic of <i>Death </i>or the magic of <i>the </i><i>Underworld</i>.<br /> <br /> Personally I'd prefer it to be the magic of the Underworld. Remember that the underworld shapes itself to the desires/habits of those living in it (or at least that was the case in 2nd ed), how much more powerful would not necromancy be in the Underworld compared to what sorcery is. Of course, sorcery is more generally available and useful, but I feel that in the Underworld necromancy should surpass whatever you can do with sorcery in other realms.<br /> <br /> Raising mansions (rather than the crude structures terrestrial sorcery can), creating plasmic underworld animals and vegetation, turn ghosts into a somber elemental of the Underworld (more a working than a spell), command the weather of the underworld, grave goods spells (like gifting a long dead ghost with an objects that turn into grave goods, bless grave goods to become more potent etc). Perhaps being able to (at least temporarily) pull things back from the labyrinth, great steeds, lost books of learning and whatnot.<br /> <br /> At least in earlier editions the Underworld was not only composed of Abyssal essence, but of Elemental essence (although slightly changed by the underworld). Personally I'd like it if necromancy would reflect this. Like for example a Ritual of Elemental Empowerment, but reflected for the somber elements of the Underworld. The benediction of fire might not warm your body, but rather enflame your passions, making it easier to safeguard your intimacies from erosion.<br /> <br /> This is all a rather far cry from 'Death Magic' though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1226-gammelbraxen","name":"Gammelbraxen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T06:35:16-08:00","id":1170416,"title":"","content":"Manipulating lower emotions of the living","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T08:12:55-08:00","id":1170432,"title":"","content":"i would hope transport between creation and the underworld, without the need of a Shadowland, i could see at the higher end and/or with a working the creation of artificial shadowlands, i mean without mass murder","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12845-ahather","name":"ahather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12845_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T08:26:21-08:00","id":1170436,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/1170311-what-do-you-want-necromancy-to-do#post1170311\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there anything else you want it to be able to do?</div> </div> </div> </div>Become a shade of a person struggling to retain her own dwindling vitality. A necromancer should be powerful, but her terrifying power should come at a cost. Much like how a ghost is fettered to existence through memories of life, a necromancer should be fettered to her own humanity. Her necromantic powers claw into her soul and take something from her whenever she taps into them. They are like the suction of a black hole---tempting, comforting, but terrifying. The necromancer should fear and love her own power in equal measure. Her power itself should be a conduit for the will of the Neverborn---it's called control spell because <i>it's</i> controlling <i>you</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T14:59:21-08:00","id":1170529,"title":"","content":"As I recall necromancy had a few cool mirror spells. I'd like to see that aspect explored more deeply.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T04:22:20-08:00","id":1170644,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/1170311-what-do-you-want-necromancy-to-do?p=1170529#post1170529\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As I recall necromancy had a few cool mirror spells. I'd like to see that aspect explored more deeply.</div> </div> </div> </div>When you say mirror spells do you mean the abyssal variants of solar charms or spells that affects mirrors?<br /> <br /> Cause adding spells that &quot;channels&quot; reflections as the underworld is a dark reflection of creation then ooooh yeeeeees that would be awesome!<br /> Imagine something like, you create an &quot;evil twin style&quot; reflection of another character. It could make for some pretty neat story hooks!<br /> <br /> Other than that I would say let necromancer have the ability to turn demi-immortal or turn other demi-immortal.<br /> Example, a necromancer removes an individuals heart. As long as the heart remains unharmed the heartless individual will recover from any injury.<br /> A necromancer can also use the heart to control the heartless person.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T05:40:04-08:00","id":1170658,"title":"","content":"Memory manipulation. Manipulation and control of the monsters in the underworld.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1g_IC644YJoiVAm6ngqcBmsQtff2YYtd3pDbZpaOxx4o\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Character Creation Tool may be downloaded here.</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1086797-demac-s-exalted-character-creation-tool\" target=\"_blank\">The thread talking about the tool can be found here.</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1136654-exalted-seats-of-power\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted: Seats of Power is a homebrewed manse creation system.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1oaq3wk7lJKZ022SUA4iPfGzMpmBTNXlM\" target=\"_blank\">I have a rewrite of the craft system which can be downloaded here.</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1070312-i-got-my-book-it-s-super-fancy-and-i-can-t-read-the-cover/page2\" target=\"_blank\">I like the Mesoamerican look</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2346-demac","name":"Demac","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"385"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T06:49:23-08:00","id":1170663,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fiikragg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/1170311-what-do-you-want-necromancy-to-do?p=1170397#post1170397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">'''Imortality''' for those of the desperate mortal persausion. So many Liminals........ so so many...........</div> </div> </div> </div>Liminals are Exalted, and rare ones to boot. It is highly unlikely that Necromancy will have something, or anything at all, directly to do with their creation. Not that it can't be a part of a certain Liminal's backstory, but it won't be the cause of the Exaltation.<br /> <br /> Exaltation, of any kind, is a miracle that will always be beyond game mechanics.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T07:35:21-08:00","id":1170670,"title":"","content":"I'm honestly not sure why we should get Necromantic workings. If you want to create a sin against life, you probably want to do it repeatedly enough to have a spell for it. So, a specific spell for Skeleton Archers, for Spine-Ladders, for Infecting Livestock With Dancing Bone Disease, etc...<br /> <br /> Likewise, if you want to bridge two lands of the dead together or erect mansions in the Underworld, you probably want to do that again in other parts of the Underworld, if necessary.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-26T08:22:23-08:00","id":1170683,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/1170311-what-do-you-want-necromancy-to-do?p=1170670#post1170670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm honestly not sure why we should get Necromantic workings. If you want to create a sin against life, you probably want to do it repeatedly enough to have a spell for it. So, a specific spell for Skeleton Archers, for Spine-Ladders, for Infecting Livestock With Dancing Bone Disease, etc...<br /> <br /> Likewise, if you want to bridge two lands of the dead together or erect mansions in the Underworld, you probably want to do that again in other parts of the Underworld, if necessary.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> One off creations, curses, things above your level (or maybe normally not availble. Idk if we will be able to bind a nephwrack), creating a shadowland, etc. You might want to, but I'd say that those spells are elaborate enough to be workings (just like how mutating minions is a working for sorcery, even though I might want to do it over and over again.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-27T07:51:51-08:00","id":1170946,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/1170311-what-do-you-want-necromancy-to-do?p=1170644#post1170644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When you say mirror spells do you mean the abyssal variants of solar charms or spells that affects mirrors?<br /> <br /> Cause adding spells that &quot;channels&quot; reflections as the underworld is a dark reflection of creation then ooooh yeeeeees that would be awesome!<br /> Imagine something like, you create an &quot;evil twin style&quot; reflection of another character. It could make for some pretty neat story hooks!</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that is exactly what I mean. There was also a spell that let you travel to the Underworld through a mirror. Using mirrors as a medium to tap into he Underworld as a dark reflection of Creation is an area full of possibility.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-27T09:06:12-08:00","id":1170966,"title":"","content":"Given that the underworld is a violation of the working order of creation, I think the concept of stasis/not allowing things to change should be worked into necromancy on a more conceptual level not necessarily associated with death. Assuming Abyssals retain the chivalry of death and static feudalism themes, this would dovetail nicely with that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Incentive is not permission or justification.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/255-paranoiacombo","name":"ParanoiaCombo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar255_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-27T10:43:37-08:00","id":1170994,"title":"","content":"What distinctions do you want or expect to see between Necromantic spells and Abyssal Charms?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T13:00:50-08:00","id":1171313,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/1170311-what-do-you-want-necromancy-to-do?p=1170994#post1170994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What distinctions do you want or expect to see between Necromantic spells and Abyssal Charms?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The same as between Sorcery and any other splat's Charms. There will be overlap, but I expect Necromancy to be much broader than the Abyssal Charm Set and I expect workings to do things explicitly impossible within Charms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted is an aesthetic.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5526-steamfunk","name":"Steamfunk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5526_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}